  "drivers": {
    "_doc": "Explanatory INPUTS (not menu ingredients) for the \"why\" behind protein cost moves — fed to the lead-lag analyzer (tools/_shared/cost-leadlag.js). feed-grain (corn/soybeans) is the genuine LEADING signal (USDA ERS: ~10wk chicken to ~30mo beef); diesel is coincident (moves alongside, not a leader). All index/trend, US-gov redistributable. Association with a lag, NEVER causation. Verify the series ids live, then the build computes each driver vs the protein/basket history.",
